{"id":"c68be82f52a64de5","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-onofri.md","title":"Onofri Inequality","display":"df-onofri — Onofri Inequality","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-onofri","aliases":["58-df-onofri"],"display":"df-onofri — Onofri Inequality","depends_on":["[[58-df-sobolev-space]]","[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-onofri"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-onofri</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-onofri — Onofri Inequality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"58-df-sobolev-space\">58-df-sobolev-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g,\\mathcal F,\\mu,W,u\\in V\">\\(S,g,\\mathcal F,\\mu,W,u\\in V\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{\\mathrm{round}}\">\\(g_{\\mathrm{round}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\mathrm{round}}\">\\(\\mu_{\\mathrm{round}}\\)</span> denote the standard metric and area measure on the unit sphere <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb S^2\">\\(\\mathbb S^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(S,g)\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(S,g)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(S,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(S,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(S)=4\\pi\">\\(\\mu(S)=4\\pi\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,S,2,1,2)\">\\(\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,S,2,1,2)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"58-df-sobolev-space\">58-df-sobolev-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Onofri}_S(u;S,g,\\mathcal F,\\mu,W)\">\\(\\operatorname{Onofri}_S(u;S,g,\\mathcal F,\\mu,W)\\)</span> (inequality predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}onofri}\\vdash\\operatorname{Onofri}_S(u;S,g,\\mathcal F,\\mu,W)\\leftrightarrow S=\\mathbb S^2\\land g=g_{\\mathrm{round}}\\land\\mathcal F=\\mathcal B(\\mathbb S^2)\\land\\mu=\\mu_{\\mathrm{round}}\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(S,g)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(S,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\mu(S)=4\\pi\\land\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,S,2,1,2)\\land u\\in W\\land\\log\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{4\\pi}\\int_S e^u\\,d\\mu\\right)\\leq\\frac{1}{16\\pi}\\int_S\\lvert\\nabla_g u\\rvert^2\\,d\\mu+\\frac{1}{4\\pi}\\int_Su\\,d\\mu\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}onofri}\\vdash\\operatorname{Onofri}_S(u;S,g,\\mathcal F,\\mu,W)\\leftrightarrow S=\\mathbb S^2\\land g=g_{\\mathrm{round}}\\land\\mathcal F=\\mathcal B(\\mathbb S^2)\\land\\mu=\\mu_{\\mathrm{round}}\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(S,g)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(S,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\mu(S)=4\\pi\\land\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,S,2,1,2)\\land u\\in W\\land\\log\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{4\\pi}\\int_S e^u\\,d\\mu\\right)\\leq\\frac{1}{16\\pi}\\int_S\\lvert\\nabla_g u\\rvert^2\\,d\\mu+\\frac{1}{4\\pi}\\int_Su\\,d\\mu\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Onofri (1982): sharp Moser–Trudinger on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{S}^2\">\\(\\mathbb{S}^2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Relates to Liouville equation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta f + e^{2f} = 1\">\\(\\Delta f + e^{2f} = 1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The sharp constants stated here are tied to the unit round sphere; variants on other manifolds require separate hypotheses and constants.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sobolev-space","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sobolev-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(S,g)$ (see [[58-df-riemannian-manifold]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(S,\\mathcal F,\\mu)$ and $\\mu(S)=4\\pi$ (see [[58-df-measure-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sobolev-space","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,S,2,1,2)$ (see [[58-df-sobolev-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,g,\\mathcal F,\\mu,W,u\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"g_{\\mathrm{round}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_{\\mathrm{round}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb S^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(S,g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(S,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(S)=4\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,S,2,1,2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Onofri}_S(u;S,g,\\mathcal F,\\mu,W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}onofri}\\vdash\\operatorname{Onofri}_S(u;S,g,\\mathcal F,\\mu,W)\\leftrightarrow S=\\mathbb S^2\\land g=g_{\\mathrm{round}}\\land\\mathcal F=\\mathcal B(\\mathbb S^2)\\land\\mu=\\mu_{\\mathrm{round}}\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(S,g)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(S,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\mu(S)=4\\pi\\land\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,S,2,1,2)\\land u\\in W\\land\\log\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{4\\pi}\\int_S e^u\\,d\\mu\\right)\\leq\\frac{1}{16\\pi}\\int_S\\lvert\\nabla_g u\\rvert^2\\,d\\mu+\\frac{1}{4\\pi}\\int_Su\\,d\\mu","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{S}^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta f + e^{2f} = 1","display":false}],"bytes":1587,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-903","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-onofri.md|58-df-onofri]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["38c58fda0da62833","04b9f5c6479b7ecd","83a15c7e9b3817dc"]}